# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data — conversations, workspaces, learner profile, API keys.
# Never commit any of this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
.test-data/

# Data dumps handed over for review（另一台机器的整个 data/：真会话 + API 配置）。
# 里面装着别的机器的真实数据与密钥，绝不入库。
data.zip
/*.zip

# Build & packaging output
dist/
build/*.blockmap
*.tgz

# Local caches & backups
.pack-data-backup/
.electron-cache/
.npm-cache/
*.backup-*.json
profile-log.jsonl

# Developer probe output (the probe scripts themselves are tracked)
# 卫生 A/B 的跑批产物：含题面原文与模型产出（可能很大，也不该进仓库）
.probe/hygiene-ab/
# 成本 A/B 的跑批产物：同题跑两臂的 records + 逐次调用记账
.probe/cost-ab/
# 稀释/输出预算 2×2 探针的产物（第一轮默认 12 分钟超时 / 第二轮 --call-timeout-min 32）
.probe/dilution/
.probe/dilution-t32/
# 推理预算实验的产物（关思考 / 想完再转写两臂的每轮输出：思考正文、token、耗时）
.probe/nothink/
.probe/thinkwrite/
# 判分尺子的中间产物：oracle-at-max.js 落盘的大规模随机用例（每份几百 KB，纯调试用）
.probe/tmp/
# 提示词体量盘点的机器可读转储（.md 报告进仓库，.json 是原始数据，太大）
.probe/prompt-inventory.json
.probe/rendered.html
.probe/*.txt
.probe/richdoc-*.html
.probe/*.json
.probe/*.har
.probe/*.log
.probe/cookies*
.cf-dump/
smoke.png

# Ablation experiment output: raw model answers, transcripts and the token bill.
# Inputs (problem list, prompts, harness code) are tracked; results are not.
ablation/out/

# Diagnostics handed over for review. A bundle tells one machine's story and its
# file name carries that machine's hostname (by design — see lib/diagbundle.js);
# a report about it does too. These are "the scene of the accident" artefacts,
# not sources: keep them out of the repo even if someone drops them at the root.
cfcoach-diag-*.md
cfcoach-diag-*.txt

# Ablation experiment INPUTS that are other people's content or machine-specific:
#   · statements/*.txt  — Codeforces problem texts (CF's copyright, not ours)
#   · oracle/           — accepted submissions used as the judging standard
#   · problems.json     — your real problem list (keep the example committed instead)
# The protocol, the example problem and all the code stay tracked.
ablation/statements/*.txt
ablation/oracle/
ablation/problems.json

# Python bytecode caches. The sandbox helper (lib/sandbox/sitecustomize.py) is
# compiled on first run, and a .pyc embeds the absolute path of the machine that
# compiled it — i.e. it can carry local directory names into a public repo.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Logs & local scratch
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# Editor / OS
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
